# The activity-log dump mdoc-e2e's -logs flag writes, at the path its doc
# comment suggests running it from the repository root with. It is one run's
# output from one developer's wallet, not a fixture.
/mdoc-logs.json

# Editor settings are per-developer: the Go/gopls CGO_ENABLED and toolchain PATH
# entries needed on one machine (e.g. an msys64 install on Windows) are wrong on
# every other one.
.vscode/
